Generated by tools/gen-xfwm4-theme.py; run `make theme`; do not edit by hand.

A flat title bar: one border row over a solid fill, #141414 when the
window has focus and #000000 when it does not, so focus reads as a change
of surface and the chrome spends no colour. The buttons are 1 px glyphs on
that fill, the frame is a 1 px line, and there is no menu button:
right-click the title bar or press Alt+Space for the window menu. Resize
with Alt+right-drag, since the 1 px border is hard to grab. The two top
corners are border colour all the way down, so the side line is unbroken
beside the title.
